  "content": "<h2>星云闪烁（蓝色）</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>特性</h2>\n<h5>(由于这些特性，您的原版体验将进一步提升)</h5>\n<h5>此功能会将您标准的原版附魔物品和盔甲闪烁效果替换为酷炫的深蓝色星云闪烁，在黑暗中看起来非常棒！如需最大效果，请在辅助设置中将“闪烁强度”调整为 100%。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>请将文件放入您的 resourcepacks 文件夹内，并在游戏内的资源包菜单中启用。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/764/2024-05-10_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j58K0FVWknU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就组建一个服务器并与朋友们一起游玩吧！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a> 或下方横幅，并使用优惠码<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>即可享受 25% 的折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
